"""SMAJ18A - unidirectional TVS diode, 400 W, 18 V standoff, DO-214AC (SMA). Bare part.

Datasheet: Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology, SMAJ series, Rev 2.2 (5 pages), LCSC C19077538.

Maximum ratings (p1, Ta = 25 C): PPPM 400 W for a 10/1000 us pulse (Fig. 1, derated above
25 C per Fig. 2); PM(AV) 1.0 W on an infinite heat sink at TL = 75 C; IFSM 40 A (8.3 ms half
sine); VF 3.5 V max at 25 A; TJ -55 to 150 C; RthJL 30 C/W, RthJA 120 C/W typical (5.0 x 5.0 mm
copper per terminal, note 2).
Electrical characteristics (p2 table, SMAJ18A row; marking BT): VRWM 18 V standoff; VBR 20 V min,
22.1 V max at IT 1 mA; VC 29.2 V max at IPP 13.7 A; IR 1 uA max at VRWM.
Failure mode: typically a short from over-specified voltage or current (p1 features).

Package (p2, SMA/DO-214AC): body B 3.95-4.65 x C 2.35-2.85 mm, D 1.98-2.41 mm high, G 4.70-5.30 mm
over the leads; leads A 1.25-1.65 mm wide, E 0.76-1.52 mm long. The datasheet draws no land
pattern. Polarity: the cathode band (unidirectional parts, p2 note 1).

Pins: pad 1 cathode (K), pad 2 anode (A), as KiCad's D_SMA footprint numbers them; its land
(2.5 x 1.8 mm pads, 1.5 mm apart) takes every lead in the package's tolerances (inner lead ends
0.83-1.89 mm from the centre, outer 2.35-2.65 mm; lead width up to 1.65 mm).

This is the stdlib Tvs generic's part, packaged to carry its datasheet limits for the board's
test benches (breakdown and clamping voltages).
"""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Voltage")
load("@stdlib/units.zen", Watts="Power")

A = io(Net)
K = io(Net)

# p2 table, SMAJ18A row; p1 maximum ratings.
reverse_standoff_voltage = Voltage("18V")
breakdown_voltage = Voltage("20V to 22.1V")
clamping_voltage = Voltage("29.2V")  # max at IPP 13.7 A, 10/1000 us
peak_pulse_power = Watts("400W")

Component(
    name="D",
    prefix="D",
    symbol=Symbol(library="SMAJ18A.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("D_SMA.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="SMAJ18A", manufacturer="Hongjiacheng"),
    pins={
        "A": A,
        "K": K,
    },
    properties={
        "value": "18V TVS 400W",
        "reverse_standoff_voltage": reverse_standoff_voltage,
        "breakdown_voltage": breakdown_voltage,
        "clamping_voltage": clamping_voltage,
        "peak_pulse_power": peak_pulse_power,
    },
    type="tvs",
)
